{"text": "Caught in a whirlpool, he was spun around until he was thrown onto a gravel bank, far out of the soldiers sight. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He dug his fingers into the sand and wept with joy, and the trees around him looked as beautiful as a garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When a cannonball crashed through the branches above his head, he jumped up and rushed into the forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All that day he walked on, guided by the sun, but the forest seemed to have no end. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By nightfall he was tired, hungry, and footsore, but the thought of his wife and children kept him moving. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last he found a wide, straight road leading toward home, but strangely there were no fields or houses along it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nowhere could he hear even the barking of a dog, and the black trees stood on both sides like high walls. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Above him the stars looked strange, shining in groups he had never seen, and he heard whispers in an unknown language. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His neck was badly swollen, his tongue was dry with thirst, and at last he fell asleep while still walking.", "alignment": {"characters": ["C", "a", "u", "g", "h", "t", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "w", "h", "i", "r", "l", "p", "o", "o", "l", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "s", "p", "u", "n", " ", "a", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "u", "n", "t", "i", "l", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "h", "r", "o", "w", "n", " ", "o", "n", "t", "o", " ", "a", " ", "g", "r", "a", "v", "e", "l", " ", "b", "a", "n", "k", ",", " ", "f", "a", "r", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "o", "l", "d", "i", "e", "r", "s", " ", "s", "i", "g", "h", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "d", "u", "g", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "f", "i", "n", "g", "e", "r", "s", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t",